<div class="surfdoc-summary" role="doc-abstract"><div class="surfdoc-summary-label">Summary</div><p>The 0.47.0 interaction grammar on one adaptive shell: the shell's key chords
(the Mac's mod+1 to mod+5, mod+k and mod+w as source), a per-button key=,
a focus order on the seats and controls, a hover reveal with its keyboard
path, the two-pane declaration, a native seat and the surface ids the
parity ledger checks against the source.</p></div>
